<title>UK: CIBC Wood Gundy expands London economics team.</title>
<headline>CIBC Wood Gundy expands London economics team.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>CIBC Wood Gundy Plc, the London based arm of Canadian Imperial Bank of Commerce has hired Audrey Chide-Freeman as Junior Economist.</p>
<p>Chide-Freeman, who joined from I.D.E.A. in London where she covered the French economy, will report to David Coleman, Chief European Economist.</p>
<p>&quot;This will enhance our economic research capability in Europe at a crucial time ahead of economic and monetary union and complements our existing U.S. and Canadian coverage,&quot; Coleman said.</p>
<p>-  London newsroom + 44 171 542 6284</p>
